       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of INVIMA is to act as a national reference institution in health matters and to execute the policies formulated by the Ministry of Health and Social Protection in terms of health surveillance and quality control of medicines, biological products, foods, beverages, cosmetics, medical-surgical and dental devices and elements, homeopathic natural products and those generated by biotechnology, diagnostic reagents, and others that may have an impact on individual and collective health</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
