      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">What has been achieved is that INVIMA has good knowledge about the development, design and testing phases of the standards for e-certifications. A complete plan has been drawn up for this. The actual implementation of this plan (making changes to IT systems and using the e-certification systems did not occur.</narrative>
